xt":"Each source is discovered first. Then, for each vertex in the order discovered, its out-edges","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are reported as tree edges (to an undiscovered vertex, which is then discovered) or non-tree","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edges (to a discovered one); then the vertex is finished. In a directed graph every out-edge of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an explored vertex is reported. In an undirected graph each edge is reported once, from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"end whose edges are examined first: the tree edge is not reported again from the vertex it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"discovered, but a parallel edge to the parent is a non-tree edge, and a self-loop is one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"non-tree edge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"title":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEvent"}],"externalID":"s:9Traversal27EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEventO","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Enumeration","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Traversal\/EdgeSearchEvents.swift#L14","fileName":"EdgeSearchEvents.swift"}},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeBreadthFirstSearchEvent","interfa